; Intro text: strings 38-42, shown on the intro screen of room 0
;
; The Cathar story, printed by the script of room 0 (#R$726A): strings 38-40 (the Cathars expelled from the Languedoc
; by the Catholic Church) at the top of the screen and 41-42 (Jean Raymond runs to escape the crusaders) at the
; bottom. The game's text spells it "Lanquedoc".
@label=IntroText
t$927C DEFM $1E,"13th Century. The Cathars were"  ; string 38
 $929B DEFM $1E,"being expelled by the Catholic"  ; string 39
 $92BA DEFM $1B,"Church out of the Lanquedoc"  ; string 40
 $92D6 DEFM $17,"The Cathar Jean Raymond"  ; string 41
 $92EE DEFM $1F,"runs to escape the crusaders..."  ; string 42
